{"game": "remnant-2", "language": "english", "appid": 1282100, "month": "2024-05", "window": 3, "start_date": 1715817600, "end_date": 1716508799, "month_true_total": 604, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-09-12 14:55:05 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "165937066", "author": {"steamid": "76561199076834508", "personaname": "TickleTown", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199076834508/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 88, "playtime_forever": 5373, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 4581, "last_played": 1727471851, "avatar": "8bfab07bd5d55156e91f392445c07008fccdbc57"}, "language": "english", "review": "Remnant 2 is an incredible game with Loads of content, secrets, Massive Replay Value and immaculate gameplay. I have 100 percent of the achievements. But nowhere near all of the gear in the game. Which is a testament of the secrets and replay value that exist in this game. Overall I absolutely loved this game. It offered everything imaginable. If you think there is a crazy build you can try in this game. Chances are you can with the amount of loot and Archetypes available after you find them. Some of them are a pain in the ass to find. Grab a Buddy or two. And enjoy this amazing game. Final Score. 9/9.5. My only gripe is that sometimes its tedious to get an achievement or item by rerolling a adventure. And that sometimes Enemies become Stale. But overall I think most people will get their Moneys worth. Which is extremely hard to come by these days.", "timestamp_created": 1716503745, "timestamp_updated": 1716505630, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.523809552192687988", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1690300800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "165933390", "author": 